摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A universal path-backed attachment dock for DeepSeek Harness . ( Unmaintained/Deprecated )","id":"gh:1334940505","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-paste-to-path","slug":"Johnny-xuan/dsh-paste-to-path","topics":["attachment","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A universal path-backed attachment dock for DeepSeek Harness . ( Unmaintained/Deprecated )"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-paste-to-path"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **A universal attachment dock for DSH.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Final release — v0.0.7**\n>\n> DSH now provides an official generic-file attachment"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" pipeline, so the compatibility gap this plugin was created to fill has been closed. Version `0.0.7`"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" is the final release; no further versions are planned.\n>\n> DSH Native owns ordinary files and image"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"s by default. Enable **Take over DSH Native attachments** only when you explicitly want the classic "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"path-backed P2P workflow. Long-text conversion remains independently available."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The rest of this README documents the classic P2P workflow available when takeover is enabled."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"`dsh-paste-to-path` adds a general-purpose attachment Dock to the DSH Web composer."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Paste, drop, or choose images, PDFs, Word and Excel documents, archives, code, logs, and other files"},{"id":"p8s2","text":", then review and manage them together before sending."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Images, PDFs, archives, and other formats share one attachment Dock."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The DSH `0.1.2-rc.1` Web composer has a native image attachment path, but PDFs, Office documents, ar"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"chives, and other formats do not have the same model-independent entry point. Even an image may fail"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" when the selected model does not support image input or the active adapter is text-only."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"`dsh-paste-to-path` does not extend the model's native content types. It takes a simpler route:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Send images to your own vision tool, PDFs to a document reader, and archives to shell or extraction "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"mages to your own vision tool, PDFs to a document reader, and archives to shell or extraction tools."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The plugin owns **attachment intake, management, and path delivery**. Your Agent tool stack decides "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"how to read the file."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Path flow at a glance"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The file is saved on the DSH Host, then its path is given to the Agent."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Universal attachment Dock"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Paste, drop, or choose a file and an attachment card appears above the composer. The plugin's paperc"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"lip button accepts any file type and routes it through this Dock rather than DSH's native image rail"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ip button accepts any file type and routes it through this Dock rather than DSH's native image rail."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Each card shows the file name, size, category, and path. You can remove it before sending."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Images also have thumbnails and lightbox previews."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### File-manager clipboard support"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### One flow for many file types"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Images, PDFs, Office documents, code, logs, archives, and other binary files all use the same attach"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"Fs, Office documents, code, logs, archives, and other binary files all use the same attachment flow:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"When you paste, drop, or choose a file, the plugin catches it and saves a private copy on the DSH Ho"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n you paste, drop, or choose a file, the plugin catches it and saves a private copy on the DSH Host:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The composer does not contain the file's contents. It keeps an attachment reference instead."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"If you paste an absolute path that already exists on the DSH Host, the plugin links that existing fi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"le instead of copying it. Linked files are never editable from the Dock."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"When you send the message, DSH's reference codec expands that reference into a short path instructio"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"en you send the message, DSH's reference codec expands that reference into a short path instruction:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The implementation uses DSH's extension mechanisms:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- `conversation.input.dock`\n- `conversation.input.left`\n- input-trigger reference codec\n- `settingsS"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"nversation.input.dock`\n- `conversation.input.left`\n- input-trigger reference codec\n- `settingsScope`"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"No DSH core modification is required."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## What the Agent receives"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The plugin does not put file bytes in the initial model request."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"For example, a PDF expands to:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"An image expands similarly:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Text, code, archives, and other formats receive equivalent path instructions."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The instructions do not require a particular tool. The Agent decides what to do next from the tools "},{"id":"p44s2","text":"that are actually available in the current session."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Why paths"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"In DSH's native attachment path, supported file formats and model capabilities are closely related."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"In DSH `0.1.2-rc.1`, the native Web image intake accepts:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- PNG\n- JPEG\n- WebP\n- GIF"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"Other MIME types do not enter the same native image path."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"An image that passes the format check may still fail if it reaches a model without image input or a "},{"id":"p50s2","text":"es the format check may still fail if it reaches a model without image input or a text-only adapter."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"`dsh-paste-to-path` separates two concerns:"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"and:"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"The plugin handles only the first."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"The file becomes an ordinary file on the Host. The Agent's tool layer handles the second."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"Files chosen, dropped, or exposed as browser `File` objects are uploaded to your own DSH Host and sa"},{"id":"p58s2","text":"ved on its local filesystem. Existing Host paths are only linked in place."},{"id":"p59s1","text":"In classic takeover mode, every plugin HTTP route uses DSH's browser authentication and Host/Origin "},{"id":"p59s2","text":"trust checks. Attachment records are isolated by session, and route registrations are removed with t"},{"id":"p59s3","text":"he plugin's Cordis lifecycle."},{"id":"p60s1","text":"The plugin itself does not:"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"- upload files directly to a model provider\n- upload files to a third-party file service\n- parse fil"},{"id":"p61s2","text":"e contents during upload"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"The initial model request contains only the file path and a short instruction."},{"id":"p63s1","text":"If the Agent later uses another tool or external service to process the file, that tool's own behavi"},{"id":"p63s2","text":"or and configuration apply."},{"id":"p64s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p65s1","text":"The final release, `0.0.7`, targets:"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"It has been tested with DSH `0.1.6-alpha.2`. Users maintaining older DSH installations without offic"},{"id":"p67s2","text":"ial generic-file attachments can pin `dsh-paste-to-path@0.0.6`."},{"id":"p68s1","text":"No further plugin releases are planned because DSH now owns and maintains the attachment architectur"},{"id":"p68s2","text":"e this project originally supplied."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
